    "details": "The Rauthy project reports:\n\n> WebAuthn authentication code is not bound to the user.\n> (GHSA-x8jp-v2j6-6vjf)\n>\n> Refresh-token grant accepts a caller-supplied client without verifyinG\n> it matches the token\\'s \\`azp\\`, allowing cross-client token minting\n> and identity/scope confusion.\n> (https://github.com/sebadob/rauthy/security/advisories/GHSA-7qh2-3hc5-2vqp)\n>\n> Unauthenticated remote panic aborts the whole process on two token\n> endpoints (short refresh_token / device_code). (GHSA-wx92-7mmw-5x82)\n",
